{
  "@context": "https://www.w3.org/2022/wot/td/v1.1",
  "@type": "tm:ThingModel",
  "title": "Module: queue of issues",
  "titles": {
    "en": "Module: queue of issues",
    "ru": "Модуль «Очередь бед»"
  },
  "description": "Written by akt-priority every 5 model minutes; auto_call = {seq, issue, role, sim_time}. Decisions in the queue: hard ore (blend), grid cut (what to shed first and its cost), shortage of return water, fire at the HPGR (S0). Shift handover sheet at 07:30 and 19:30 model time: handover {at, text, issues, snoozed, sensors, ore, crews}, handover_draft_text (what to hand over now); escalations {issue-N: {t, eta, text}}: a called person or crew not arrived by ETA + 15 min. Deviations (grinding media overuse) go to deviations/deviations_text, not to the queue; decisions = calls of the shift against the model's order, review_text = 'what if you had called otherwise' for the handover; tariff = hourly tariff band (assumption). Issue: chain (main -> deputy -> shift head), chain_text, choice_text.",
  "version": {
    "model": "1.0.0"
  },
